data: {"id": "79543d1bb6224277-final", "run_id": "79543d1bb6224277", "seq": 1459, "ts_ms": 1788453655844, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-fl85h` | CrashLoopBackOff | CrashLoopBackOff |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.last_terminated_reason: OOMKilled`, `last_exit_code: 137` | 核心事实：确认容器因内存超限被内核强制终止 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `BackOff 25s (x261 over 68m)` | 现象佐证：频繁重启导致指数退避延迟 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | `container.resource_limit.memory: 64Mi`, `request.memory: 24Mi` | 边界确认：64Mi 硬限制与 24Mi 请求值严重不匹配 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `container_memory_working_set_bytes` 突增至 25956352 (约 24.7Mi)，此前稳定在 3.2~3.7Mi | 资源消耗轨迹：正常运行时极低，崩溃前出现异常跳升 |\n| 5 | Logging | Elasticsearch | `log.message: \"memory allocation advanced\"`, `allocated_mib` 从 12 增至 46 | 应用行为：请求处理期间内存申请量逼近容器限制上限 |\n| 6 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `pod.status: Running`, `restart_count: 15` | 容器状态：尽管 CrashLoopBackOff 处于等待期，最后一次尝试已处于 Running 状态 |\n\n**证据交叉验证：**\nKubernetes 的 OOMKilled 终止原因 (1, 2) 与 Prometheus 内存跳升指标 (4) 直接对应。日志中 `allocated_mib` 增长至 46 MiB (5) 的数据，解释了为何在 64 MiB 硬限制 (3) 下会触发 OOM。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nMemory limit (64Mi) insufficient for workload → Application memory usage exceeds limit during request processing → Linux OOM Killer terminates container process (Exit Code 137) → Kubelet detects termination and retries, entering CrashLoopBackOff\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：\n容器内存限制过低。应用程序在处理请求时内存需求激增（从常态约 3 MiB 跃升至接近限制值），导致进程超过配置的 64 MiB 硬性内存上限，被 Linux 内核 OOM Killer 强制终止 (Exit Code 137, fact 1, fact 6, fact 4, fact 5)。Kubelet 随后不断重启该容器，触发 BackOff 机制，表现为 CrashLoopBackOff (fact 2)。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.7m\n├─ 问题定位: 20.1s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 70.5s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-fl85h: 70.5s (Evidence 60.7s, RCA 9.7s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.5s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-fl85h**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 100.059, "metrics": {"run_id": "79543d1bb6224277", "mttr": {"value": "1.7m", "seconds": 100.0635814666748, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 100063.5814666748, "llm_calls": 13, "llm_duration_ms": 74141.8182849884, "tool_calls": 15, "executed_tool_calls": 13, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 2, "successful_tool_calls": 15, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 38586.1234664917, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 25509.915351867676}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "